{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/story.png?t=1740990707\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the embodiment of the last thought of hope to enter a suicidal mind!<br><br> battling your inner demons and corrupted thoughts to reclaim what ever is left of a shattered psyche in modern Rogue lite setting, over 50 weapons, passive abilities, skill trees and all the goodness you would expect of a Rogue title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/Shadow_Dreams_Logo.png?t=1740990707\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/GamePlay.png?t=1740990707\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MAGIC BASED FPS ACTION</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield an arsenal of powerful spells that represent internal emotions ranging from Passion, Rage, Fear, and Fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/Arena_Intro.0926.jpg?t=1740990707\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AWESOME FINISHERS </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's not a cool demon slaying FPS without brutal finishers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We blended the magical move sets with our beloved wrestling inspired moves to finish your enemies in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THE 5 KINGDOMS AND WHAT'S IN BETWEEN </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the last thought of hope, it'll be your task to restore balance to this twisted mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will journey as a single thought, born in the Panic Pit all the way to the 5 kingdoms that make up your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/shot18__15_.jpg?t=1740990707\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DARK AND GOTHIC AESTHETIC </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A gothic and medieval theme prevails in the world design, filled with magic, whimsical creatures and dragons! You've got to have dragons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/shot21__280_.jpg?t=1740990707\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PSYCHOLOGICALLY INSPIRED STORY </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/Arena_Intro.0818.jpg?t=1740990707\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore emotions, feelings and thoughts, visualized into characters, friends and foes!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the aim of improving your mental health awareness through storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443900?t=1740990707","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740990707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/7a110f29e0c012b96b0f2f2d932eeddf6ea163e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740990707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/7a110f29e0c012b96b0f2f2d932eeddf6ea163e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740990707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>NYX Award Winner!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/smallaward.gif?t=1740990707\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/story.png?t=1740990707\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the embodiment of the last thought of hope to enter a suicidal mind!<br><br> battling your inner demons and corrupted thoughts to reclaim what ever is left of a shattered psyche in modern Rogue lite setting, over 50 weapons, passive abilities, skill trees and all the goodness you would expect of a Rogue title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/Shadow_Dreams_Logo.png?t=1740990707\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/GamePlay.png?t=1740990707\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MAGIC BASED FPS ACTION</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield an arsenal of powerful spells that represent internal emotions ranging from Passion, Rage, Fear, and Fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/Arena_Intro.0926.jpg?t=1740990707\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AWESOME FINISHERS </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's not a cool demon slaying FPS without brutal finishers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We blended the magical move sets with our beloved wrestling inspired moves to finish your enemies in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THE 5 KINGDOMS AND WHAT'S IN BETWEEN </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the last thought of hope, it'll be your task to restore balance to this twisted mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will journey as a single thought, born in the Panic Pit all the way to the 5 kingdoms that make up your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/shot18__15_.jpg?t=1740990707\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DARK AND GOTHIC AESTHETIC </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A gothic and medieval theme prevails in the world design, filled with magic, whimsical creatures and dragons! You've got to have dragons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/shot21__280_.jpg?t=1740990707\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PSYCHOLOGICALLY INSPIRED STORY </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/Arena_Intro.0818.jpg?t=1740990707\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore emotions, feelings and thoughts, visualized into characters, friends and foes!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the aim of improving your mental health awareness through storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Khosouf Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/header.jpg?t=1740990707","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257086654,"m